<title>YUGOSLAVIA: Yugoslav March oil output rises to 83,000 tonnes.</title>
<headline>Yugoslav March oil output rises to 83,000 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>BELGRADE 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistics Office reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> YUGOSLAV CRUDE PETROLEUM	     MARCH 97   FEB 97   MARCH 96</p>
<p> Crude petroleum (tonnes)	     83,000     76,000    86,000</p>
<p> Natural gas (million cu.meters)	54	   48	  53</p>
<p>NOTE - Data refer to Federal Republic of Yugoslavia, comprising Serbia and Montenegro.</p>
<p>-- Beti Bilandzic, Belgrade newsroom +381 11 222 4305</p>
</text>
